{
  "id": 1461,
  "description": "# 📖 **The Library** 📖 #\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n⚔️ Do you enjoy running Dungeons?\n\n📚 Do you search for and crave Knowledge?\n\n🎲 Are you into Role Playing?\n\n❤️ Are you into helping others in the community?\n\n✨ Are you willing to worship Lord O&#039;lo in your persuit of knowledge?\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n##### 🏆 **THEN YOU CAME TO THE RIGHT PLACE!** 🏆 #####\n‼️ The Guilds Objective is to become the Go To Guild for info. So if you love working with Sheets and Collecting Data to improve to Community, we’re your Guild ‼️\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### 📋 **REQUIREMENTS:** 📋 ###\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n⚔️ Combat Level of 18 ⚔️\n\n🚫 Kicked After 7 Days of Inactivity 🚫\n\n💻 Must Join Discord Before Applying💻\n\n📒 Aiding in the Collection of More Recipes 📒\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### 🔥 **WHAT WE OFFER:** 🔥 ###\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🔔 Raid Alerts 🔔\n\n🔔 Assault Alerts 🔔\n\n🔔 World Boss Alerts 🔔\n\n🔔  Shrine Alerts 🔔\n\n⚔️ Raids Weekdays:\n22:00 and 23:00 UTC ⚔️\n\n⚔️ Assaults Saturday and Sunday ⚔️\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### ✅ **Join the Discord to Get Started!** ✅ ###\n\n🔗 https://discord.gg/pJpeZrznSM 🔗",
